, 24484, 2262, 535, 3617, 23432, 308, 277, 2279, 10030, 6061, 12, 13530, 38028, 2916, 263, 24001, 360, 10572, 11, 51579], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2060916967559279, "compression_ratio": 1.4593495934959348, "no_speech_prob": 0.009259972721338272}, {"id": 16, "seek": 9600, "start": 96.0, "end": 103.6, "text": " simbolizado pela crise dos refens nem baixada dos Estados Unidos inteir\u00e3, que durou 444 dias.", "tokens": [50364, 1034, 17460, 27441, 14820, 32398, 4491, 1895, 694, 9939, 40447, 1538, 4491, 22362, 23087, 2830, 347, 1046, 11, 631, 4861, 263, 1017, 13912, 21084, 13, 50744], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16191667980617946, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 0.02973351441323757}, {"id": 17, "seek": 9600, "start": 103.6, "end": 110.2, "text": " Desde ent\u00e3o, a rela\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de amizade foi cortada, dando lugar a uma inimizade estrutural.", "tokens": [50744, 37985, 9071, 11, 257, 28177, 37189, 368, 669, 590, 762, 6901, 11278, 1538, 11, 29854, 11467, 257, 2772, 294, 12526, 762, 45899, 1807, 13, 51074], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16191667980617946, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 0.02973351441323757}, {"id": 18, "seek": 9600, "start": 110.2, "end": 114.0, "text": " Mas o que os Estados Unidos buscam na regi\u00e3o hoje?", "tokens": [51074, 5224, 277, 631, 3003, 22362, 23087, 1255, 14177, 1667, 45697, 13458, 30, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16191667980617946, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 0.02973351441323757}, {"id": 19, "seek": 9600, "start": 114.0, "end": 118.5, "text": " Quais s\u00e3o os pilares da pol\u00edtica externa americana em rela\u00e7\u00e3o ao ir\u00e3?", "tokens": [51264, 2326, 1527, 8364, 3003, 6429, 8643, 1120, 25029, 454, 391, 629, 16116, 44864, 846, 28177, 8130, 3418, 1046, 30, 51489], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16191667980617946, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 0.02973351441323757}, {"id": 20, "seek": 9600, "start": 118.5, "end": 123.1, "text": " O primeiro pilar \u00e9 a seguran\u00e7a dos aliados e estabilidade regional.", "tokens": [51489, 422, 18314, 6429, 289, 1136, 257, 49538, 4491, 10198, 4181, 308, 3947, 388, 6014, 10964, 13, 51719], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16191667980617946, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 0.02973351441323757}, {"id": 21, "seek": 12310, "start": 123.19999999999999, "end": 127.6, "text": " O Washington tiene la\u00e7os estreitos com parceiros tradicionais no Oriente M\u00e9dio,", "tokens": [50369, 422, 6149, 7066, 635, 26828, 36665, 11343, 395, 6992, 21633, 2479, 18899, 1527, 572, 23621, 1576, 376, 7811, 1004, 11, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25020647885506614, "compression_ratio": 1.460377358490566, "no_speech_prob": 0.033020563423633575}, {"id": 22, "seek": 12310, "start": 127.6, "end": 132.5, "text": " como Israel e as monarquias do golfo, especialmente a rabia saudita.", "tokens": [50589, 2617, 5674, 308, 382, 1108, 289, 358, 4609, 360, 9988, 16931, 11, 41546, 257, 14085, 654, 47863, 2786, 13, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25020647885506614, "compression_ratio": 1.460377358490566, "no_speech_prob": 0.033020563423633575}, {"id": 23, "seek": 12310, "start": 132.5, "end": 138.0, "text": " Para os Estados Unidos, qualquer expans\u00e3o da influ\u00eancia iraniana na regi\u00e3o, seja no l\u00edbano,", "tokens": [50834, 11107, 3003, 22362, 23087, 11, 20437, 9672, 1076, 1120, 4015, 9322, 3418, 282, 8497, 1667, 45697, 11, 13459, 572, 16118, 65, 3730, 11, 51109], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25020647885506614, "compression_ratio": 1.460377358490566, "no_speech_prob": 0.033020563423633575}, {"id": 24, "seek": 12310, "start": 138.0, "end": 143.79999999999998, "text": " e M. Syria ou Iraq, \u00e9 vista como uma amea\u00e7a a estabilidade de seus parceiros.", "tokens": [51109, 308, 376, 13, 13314, 2820, 11818, 11, 1136, 22553, 2617, 2772, 669, 29791, 5297, 257, 3947, 388, 6014, 368, 17004, 6992, 21633, 13, 51399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25020647885506614, "compression_ratio": 1.460377358490566, "no_speech_prob": 0.033020563423633575}, {"id": 25, "seek": 12310, "start": 143.79999999999998, "end": 147.9, "text": " O segundo ponto nevr\u00e1\u00fagico \u00e9 o programa nuclear iraniano.", "tokens": [51399, 422, 17954, 17936, 408, 85, 30218, 2481, 70, 2789, 1136, 277, 21846, 8179, 3418, 282, 6254, 13, 51604], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25020647885506614, "compression_ratio": 1.460377358490566, "no_speech_prob": 0.033020563423633575}, {"id": 26, "seek": 14790, "start": 148.0, "end": 152.4, "text": " Os Estados Unidos e seus aliados temem que ter\u00e3des envolvar armas nucleares,", "tokens": [50369, 8875, 22362, 23087, 308, 17004, 10198, 4181, 1383, 443, 631, 1796, 1046, 14792, 49995, 8517, 44611, 14962, 8643, 11, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16747075702072284, "compression_ratio": 1.515748031496063, "no_speech_prob": 0.00955225806683302}, {"id": 27, "seek": 14790, "start": 152.4, "end": 158.1, "text": " o que poderia desencadear uma corrida armamentista em uma das regi\u00f5es mais volatas do planeta.", "tokens": [50589, 277, 631, 33674, 18291, 30340, 289, 2772, 38576, 2887, 3726, 2466, 5236, 846, 2772, 1482, 1121, 72, 6036, 2420, 1996, 267, 296, 360, 34186, 13, 50874], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16747075702072284, "compression_ratio": 1.515748031496063, "no_speech_prob": 0.00955225806683302}, {"id": 28, "seek": 14790, "start": 158.1, "end": 165.1, "text": " Mesmo com acordos, como o pacto nuclear de 2015 que depois foi abandonado pelos Estados Unidos em 2018,", "tokens": [50874, 17485, 3280, 395, 38077, 329, 11, 2617, 277, 38104, 78, 8179, 368, 7546, 631, 13880, 6901, 9072, 1573, 38304, 22362, 23087, 846, 6096, 11, 51224], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16747075702072284, "compression_ratio": 1.515748031496063, "no_speech_prob": 0.00955225806683302}, {"id": 29, "seek": 14790, "start": 165.1, "end": 169.0, "text": " a desconfian\u00e7a-muta continua em n\u00edveis m\u00e1ximos.", "tokens": [51224, 257, 730, 24697, 952, 5297, 12, 76, 12093, 40861, 846, 297, 34934, 31031, 329, 13, 51419], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16747075702072284, "compression_ratio": 1.515748031496063, "no_speech_prob": 0.00955225806683302}, {"id": 30, "seek": 14790, "start": 169.0, "end": 173.20000000000002, "text": " Por fim, h\u00e1 quest\u00e3o do controle de rotas energ\u00e9ticas.", "tokens": [51419, 5269, 31603, 11, 16448, 28477, 360, 46215, 368, 4297, 296, 10575, 4051, 9150, 13, 51629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16747075702072284, "compression_ratio": 1.515748031496063, "no_speech_prob": 0.00955225806683302}, {"id": 31, "seek": 17320, "start": 173.29999999999998, "end": 180.1, "text": " O estreito de Ormuz, na Costa Iraniana, \u00e9 por onde passa uma enorme fatia do petr\u00f3leo consumido no mundo.", "tokens": [50369, 422, 36665, 3528, 368, 1610, 76, 3334, 11, 1667, 28440, 9151, 3782, 2095, 11, 1136, 1515, 14396, 23880, 2772, 33648, 4046, 654, 360, 3817, 11721, 41041, 3978, 2925, 572, 7968, 13, 50709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465328857962009, "compression_ratio": 1.4854014598540146, "no_speech_prob": 0.009850620292127132}, {"id": 32, "seek": 17320, "start": 180.1, "end": 186.29999999999998, "text": " Garantir o fluxo livre de energia \u00e9 uma prioridade estrat\u00e9gica de seguran\u00e7a nacional para Washington.", "tokens": [50709, 7995, 394, 347, 277, 19298, 78, 24735, 368, 29469, 1136, 2772, 4059, 6014, 46603, 2262, 368, 49538, 29836, 1690, 6149, 13, 51019], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465328857962009, "compression_ratio": 1.4854014598540146, "no_speech_prob": 0.009850620292127132}, {"id": 33, "seek": 17320, "start": 186.29999999999998, "end": 190.39999999999998, "text": " Do outro lado da mesa, qual \u00e9 a perspectiva de ter\u00e3?", "tokens": [51019, 1144, 13170, 11631, 1120, 37024, 11, 4101, 1136, 257, 4096, 5931, 368, 1796, 1046, 30, 51224], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465328857962009, "compression_ratio": 1.4854014598540146, "no_speech_prob": 0.009850620292127132}, {"id": 34, "seek": 17320, "start": 190.39999999999998, "end": 194.1, "text": " O que impulsionas decis\u00f5es do governo iraniano?", "tokens": [51224, 422, 631, 704, 22973, 296, 18206, 6036, 360, 34685, 3418, 282, 6254, 30, 51409], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465328857962009, "compression_ratio": 1.4854014598540146, "no_speech_prob": 0.009850620292127132}, {"id": 35, "seek": 17320, "start": 194.1, "end": 200.1, "text": " Em primeiro lugar, o ir\u00e3o busca soberania e o reconhecimento de sua influ\u00eancia regional.", "tokens": [51409, 3968, 18314, 11467, 11, 277, 3418, 1076, 37492, 26212, 5609, 308, 277, 9993, 675, 28317, 368, 8233, 4015, 9322, 10964, 13, 51709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465328857962009, "compression_ratio": 1.4854014598540146, "no_speech_prob": 0.009850620292127132}, {"id": 36, "seek": 20010, "start": 200.2, "end": 204.2, "text": " Sendo um dos maiores pa\u00edses do Oriente M\u00e9dio em popula\u00e7\u00e3o e hist\u00f3ria,", "tokens": [50369, 318, 3999, 1105, 4491, 12698, 2706, 23070, 360, 23621, 1576, 376, 7811, 1004, 846, 32166, 2917, 308, 20670, 11, 50569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14864882776292704, "compression_ratio": 1.5770609318996416, "no_speech_prob": 0.011494500562548637}, {"id": 37, "seek": 20010, "start": 204.2, "end": 209.29999999999998, "text": " ter\u00e1 argumenta que tem o direito leg\u00edtimo de ser a pot\u00eancia dominante em sua pr\u00f3pria vizinhan\u00e7a,", "tokens": [50569, 1796, 842, 6770, 64, 631, 1383, 277, 36601, 1676, 6712, 6934, 368, 816, 257, 1847, 9322, 8859, 2879, 846, 8233, 39608, 371, 36367, 3451, 5297, 11, 50824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14864882776292704, "compression_ratio": 1.5770609318996416, "no_speech_prob": 0.011494500562548637}, {"id": 38, "seek": 20010, "start": 209.29999999999998, "end": 214.79999999999998, "text": " vendo a presen\u00e7a militar dos Estados Unidos na regi\u00e3o como uma intramiss\u00e3o imperialista.", "tokens": [50824, 33152, 257, 1183, 48866, 30653, 4491, 22362, 23087, 1667, 45697, 2617, 2772, 560, 2356, 891, 1076, 21143, 5236, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14864882776292704, "compression_ratio": 1.5770609318996416, "no_speech_prob": 0.011494500562548637}, {"id": 39, "seek": 20010, "start": 214.79999999999998, "end": 220.1, "text": " Em segundo lugar, a sobreviv\u00eancia do regime e a resist\u00eancia em sanc\u00f5es.", "tokens": [51099, 3968, 17954, 11467, 11, 257, 5473, 27810, 9322, 360, 13120, 308, 257, 4597, 9322, 846, 262, 4463, 6036, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14864882776292704, "compression_ratio": 1.5770609318996416, "no_speech_prob": 0.011494500562548637}, {"id": 40, "seek": 20010, "start": 220.1, "end": 226.5, "text": " O governo iraniano enfrenta dura sanc\u00f5es econ\u00f4micas lideradas pelos Estados Unidos a d\u00e9cadas.", "tokens": [51364, 422, 34685, 3418, 282, 6254, 33771, 64, 43416, 262, 4463, 6036, 23692, 25670, 9150, 45341, 6872, 38304, 22362, 23087, 257, 9198, 6872, 13, 51684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14864882776292704, "compression_ratio": 1.5770609318996416, "no_speech_prob": 0.011494500562548637}, {"id": 41, "seek": 22650, "start": 226.6, "end": 235.4, "text": " Para ter\u00e3, ceder as press\u00f5es americanas \u00e9 visto como um risco existencial para a pr\u00f3pria estrutura teocr\u00e1tica estabelecida em 1979.", "tokens": [50369, 11107, 1796, 1046, 11, 269, 10020, 382, 1886, 6036, 31229, 296, 1136, 17558, 2617, 1105, 2253, 1291, 2514, 26567, 1690, 257, 39608, 45899, 2991, 535, 3617, 23432, 3947, 16884, 37200, 846, 30595, 13, 50809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668463273481889, "compression_ratio": 1.480427046263345, "no_speech_prob": 0.003942026756703854}, {"id": 42, "seek": 22650, "start": 235.4, "end": 242.1, "text": " A narrativa oficial utiliza o confronto com os Estados Unidos para consolidar a poio interno nacionalista.", "tokens": [50809, 316, 6397, 18740, 37189, 4976, 13427, 277, 1497, 81, 7556, 395, 3003, 22362, 23087, 1690, 19045, 289, 257, 714, 1004, 728, 1771, 29836, 5236, 13, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668463273481889, "compression_ratio": 1.480427046263345, "no_speech_prob": 0.003942026756703854}, {"id": 43, "seek": 22650, "start": 242.1, "end": 246.5, "text": " E, claro, h\u00e1 o argumento do direito a tecnologia.", "tokens": [51144, 462, 11, 16742, 11, 16448, 277, 6770, 78, 360, 36601, 257, 44905, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668463273481889, "compression_ratio": 1.480427046263345, "no_speech_prob": 0.003942026756703854}, {"id": 44, "seek": 22650, "start": 246.5, "end": 253.5, "text": " O iran defende que seu programa nuclear tem fins estritamente pass\u00edficos, voltados para gera\u00e7\u00e3o de energia e medicina,", "tokens": [51364, 422, 3418, 282, 1060, 5445, 631, 7986, 21846, 8179, 1383, 25106, 871, 3210, 3439, 1320, 18869, 329, 11, 5962, 4181, 1690, 41289, 2917, 368, 29469, 308, 4355, 1426, 11, 51714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1668463273481889, "compression_ratio": 1.480427046263345, "no_speech_prob": 0.003942026756703854}, {"id": 45, "seek": 25350, "start": 253.5, "end": 260.0, "text": " e que sofre um tratamento desigual em compara\u00e7\u00e3o a outros pa\u00edses que possuem armas nucleares na regi\u00e3o.", "tokens": [50364, 308, 631, 370, 19325, 1105, 21507, 8824, 730, 328, 901, 846, 715, 2419, 2917, 257, 18282, 23070, 631, 1402, 50116, 44611, 14962, 8643, 1667, 45697, 13, 50689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12460613250732422, "compression_ratio": 1.5304659498207884, "no_speech_prob": 0.008055985905230045}, {"id": 46, "seek": 25350, "start": 260.0, "end": 265.3, "text": " Mas por que tudo isso importa para quem mora fora dos Estados Unidos ou do iran?", "tokens": [50689, 5224, 1515, 631, 9379, 4616, 33218, 1690, 13026, 1896, 64, 24530, 4491, 22362, 23087, 2820, 360, 3418, 282, 30, 50954], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12460613250732422, "compression_ratio": 1.5304659498207884, "no_speech_prob": 0.008055985905230045}, {"id": 47, "seek": 25350, "start": 265.3, "end": 269.5, "text": " Por que as repercuss\u00f5es desse conflito \u00e9 cumpelo globo inteiro?", "tokens": [50954, 5269, 631, 382, 28946, 2169, 6036, 17864, 1497, 75, 3528, 1136, 269, 1420, 10590, 3114, 1763, 45633, 30, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12460613250732422, "compression_ratio": 1.5304659498207884, "no_speech_prob": 0.008055985905230045}, {"id": 48, "seek": 25350, "start": 269.5, "end": 273.2, "text": " A primeira consequ\u00eancia direta \u00e9 o mercado de energia.", "tokens": [51164, 316, 21158, 7242, 9322, 1264, 1328, 1136, 277, 24775, 368, 29469, 13, 51349], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12460613250732422, "compression_ratio": 1.5304659498207884, "no_speech_prob": 0.008055985905230045}, {"id": 49, "seek": 25350, "start": 273.2, "end": 279.8, "text": " Qualquer tens\u00e3o militar no golfo p\u00e9rsico faz o pre\u00e7o do petr\u00f3leo disparar nos postos de gasolina do mundo todo,", "tokens": [51349, 13616, 8035, 10688, 1076, 30653, 572, 9988, 16931, 280, 4198, 82, 2789, 4375, 277, 42295, 360, 3817, 11721, 41041, 14548, 289, 3269, 2183, 329, 368, 4211, 39750, 360, 7968, 5149, 11, 51679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12460613250732422, "compression_ratio": 1.5304659498207884, "no_speech_prob": 0.008055985905230045}, {"id": 50, "seek": 27980, "start": 279.8, "end": 283.40000000000003, "text": " gerando infla\u00e7\u00e3o e desacelerando a economia global.", "tokens": [50364, 5713, 1806, 1536, 875, 2917, 308, 730, 326, 6185, 1806, 257, 2520, 654, 4338, 13, 50544], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12607100560114934, "compression_ratio": 1.5970695970695972, "no_speech_prob": 0.014944682829082012}, {"id": 51, "seek": 27980, "start": 283.40000000000003, "end": 287.3, "text": " Al\u00e9m disso, o conflito raramente acontece de forma direta.", "tokens": [50544, 44457, 20088, 11, 277, 1497, 75, 3528, 367, 289, 3439, 19786, 368, 8366, 1264, 1328, 13, 50739], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12607100560114934, "compression_ratio": 1.5970695970695972, "no_speech_prob": 0.014944682829082012}, {"id": 52, "seek": 27980, "start": 287.3, "end": 292.3, "text": " Ele se manifesta atrav\u00e9s de guerras por procura\u00e7\u00e3o e disputas cibern\u00e9ticas.", "tokens": [50739, 8024, 369, 8173, 7841, 39941, 368, 14486, 3906, 1515, 9510, 2991, 2917, 308, 37669, 296, 269, 5331, 77, 4051, 9150, 13, 50989], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12607100560114934, "compression_ratio": 1.5970695970695972, "no_speech_prob": 0.014944682829082012}, {"id": 53, "seek": 27980, "start": 292.3, "end": 299.7, "text": " O apoio iraniana, grupos armados em diferentes frontes do Oriente M\u00e9dio e as respostas coordenadas de Israel e dos Estados Unidos", "tokens": [50989, 422, 50165, 1004, 3418, 282, 8497, 11, 33758, 3726, 4181, 846, 17686, 1868, 279, 360, 23621, 1576, 376, 7811, 1004, 308, 382, 1597, 555, 296, 14230, 268, 6872, 368, 5674, 308, 4491, 22362, 23087, 51359], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12607100560114934, "compression_ratio": 1.5970695970695972, "no_speech_prob": 0.014944682829082012}, {"id": 54, "seek": 27980, "start": 299.7, "end": 306.7, "text": " mant\u00e9m o Oriente M\u00e9dio em um estado de tens\u00e3o cr\u00f4nica, gerando crises humanit\u00e1rias e fluxos de refugiados.", "tokens": [51359, 10845, 4011, 277, 23621, 1576, 376, 7811, 1004, 846, 1105, 18372, 368, 10688, 1076, 941, 17140, 2262, 11, 5713, 1806, 31403, 1952, 270, 24952, 308, 19298, 329, 368, 1895, 24780, 4181, 13, 51709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12607100560114934, "compression_ratio": 1.5970695970695972, "no_speech_prob": 0.014944682829082012}, {"id": 55, "seek": 30670, "start": 306.8, "end": 313.7, "text": " \u00c9 um chadr\u00eas global onde o tabuleiro \u00e9 o Oriente M\u00e9dio e as pe\u00e7as s\u00e3o movimentadas com cautela para evitar que uma fa\u00edsca", "tokens": [50369, 4922, 1105, 417, 345, 81, 11987, 4338, 14396, 277, 4421, 2271, 5182, 1136, 277, 23621, 1576, 376, 7811, 1004, 308, 382, 520, 20016, 8364, 2402, 2328, 6872, 395, 21130, 4053, 1690, 31326, 631, 2772, 2050, 5113, 496, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18382207697088068, "compression_ratio": 1.4828897338403042, "no_speech_prob": 0.0088425874710083}, {"id": 56, "seek": 30670, "start": 313.7, "end": 316.8, "text": " acidental se transformem em uma guerra em lar da escala.", "tokens": [50714, 696, 47023, 369, 4088, 443, 846, 2772, 27542, 846, 1613, 1120, 4721, 5159, 13, 50869], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18382207697088068, "compression_ratio": 1.4828897338403042, "no_speech_prob": 0.0088425874710083}, {"id": 57, "seek": 30670, "start": 316.8, "end": 324.09999999999997, "text": " Como vimos, o conflito entre Estados Unidos e iran n\u00e3o \u00e9 apenas sobre o presente, \u00e9 o resultado de choques hist\u00f3ricos profundos,", "tokens": [50869, 11913, 49266, 11, 277, 1497, 75, 3528, 3962, 22362, 23087, 308, 3418, 282, 2431, 1136, 18561, 5473, 277, 28709, 11, 1136, 277, 28047, 368, 1586, 7519, 33196, 1341, 329, 1740, 36518, 11, 51234], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18382207697088068, "compression_ratio": 1.4828897338403042, "no_speech_prob": 0.0088425874710083}, {"id": 58, "seek": 30670, "start": 324.09999999999997, "end": 329.59999999999997, "text": " disputas por recursos, soberania e vis\u00f5es de mundo totalmente opostas.", "tokens": [51234, 37669, 296, 1515, 30409, 11, 26212, 5609, 308, 1452, 6036, 368, 7968, 30865, 999, 555, 296, 13, 51509], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18382207697088068, "compression_ratio": 1.4828897338403042, "no_speech_prob": 0.0088425874710083}, {"id": 59, "seek": 32960, "start": 329.70000000000005, "end": 336.70000000000005, "text": " As solu\u00e7\u00f5es diplom\u00e1ticas parecem sempre fr\u00e1geis e a beira do colapso, mas alternativa, um confronto aberto,", "tokens": [50369, 1018, 24807, 8001, 20053, 44997, 14120, 76, 9553, 431, 842, 432, 271, 308, 257, 312, 4271, 360, 1173, 569, 539, 11, 2300, 5400, 18740, 11, 1105, 1497, 81, 7556, 410, 13098, 11, 50719], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1657240731375558, "compression_ratio": 1.495016611295681, "no_speech_prob": 0.006191160995513201}, {"id": 60, "seek": 32960, "start": 336.70000000000005, "end": 340.70000000000005, "text": " traria custos catastr\u00f3ficos para todos os envolvidos.", "tokens": [50719, 504, 9831, 14884, 329, 19754, 11721, 1786, 329, 1690, 6321, 3003, 49995, 6833, 329, 13, 50919], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1657240731375558, "compression_ratio": 1.495016611295681, "no_speech_prob": 0.006191160995513201}, {"id": 61, "seek": 32960, "start": 340.70000000000005, "end": 347.70000000000005, "text": " A grande pergunta que fica \u00e9, ser\u00e1 que a diplomacia conseguir\u00e1, um dia, superar d\u00e9cadas de desconfian\u00e7a,", "tokens": [50919, 316, 8883, 34908, 631, 16868, 1136, 11, 16502, 631, 257, 20053, 28000, 21229, 842, 11, 1105, 6801, 11, 1687, 289, 9198, 6872, 368, 730, 24697, 952, 5297, 11, 51269], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1657240731375558, "compression_ratio": 1.495016611295681, "no_speech_prob": 0.006191160995513201}, {"id": 62, "seek": 32960, "start": 347.70000000000005, "end": 352.3, "text": " um impasse continuar\u00e1 a definir as regras do jogo no s\u00e9culo XXI?", "tokens": [51269, 1105, 704, 8604, 2993, 21534, 257, 1561, 347, 382, 319, 861, 296, 360, 20068, 572, 7910, 25436, 27050, 40, 30, 51499], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1657240731375558, "compression_ratio": 1.495016611295681, "no_speech_prob": 0.006191160995513201}, {"id": 63, "seek": 32960, "start": 352.3, "end": 354.3, "text": " Eu quero saber a sua opini\u00e3o.", "tokens": [51499, 2186, 18738, 12489, 257, 8233, 46784, 1076, 13, 51599], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1657240731375558, "compression_ratio": 1.495016611295681, "no_speech_prob": 0.006191160995513201}, {"id": 64, "seek": 32960, "start": 354.3, "end": 358.90000000000003, "text": " Voc\u00ea acha que um acordo duradoro entre os dois pa\u00edses ainda \u00e9 poss\u00edvel?", "tokens": [51599, 9781, 37338, 631, 1105, 49392, 4861, 345, 10780, 3962, 3003, 11854, 23070, 11804, 1136, 29322, 30, 51829], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1657240731375558, "compression_ratio": 1.495016611295681, "no_speech_prob": 0.006191160995513201}, {"id": 65, "seek": 35890, "start": 358.9, "end": 361.9, "text": " Deixe nos coment\u00e1rios aqui embaixo.", "tokens": [50364, 1346, 42369, 3269, 43739, 3871, 36612, 13, 50514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13083978132768112, "compression_ratio": 1.259493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 0.011859884485602379}, {"id": 66, "seek": 35890, "start": 361.9, "end": 366.09999999999997, "text": " Se voc\u00ea gostou deste panorama neutro e quer ver mais conte\u00fados como este,", "tokens": [50514, 1100, 2723, 13188, 263, 38738, 2462, 32988, 7989, 340, 308, 7083, 1306, 2420, 39065, 33749, 2617, 4065, 11, 50724], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13083978132768112, "compression_ratio": 1.259493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 0.011859884485602379}, {"id": 67, "seek": 35890, "start": 366.09999999999997, "end": 370.09999999999997, "text": " n\u00e3o se esque\u00e7a de se inscrever no canal e deixar o seu like.", "tokens": [50724, 2431, 369, 28147, 5297, 368, 369, 27824, 331, 572, 9911, 308, 19701, 277, 7986, 411, 13, 50924], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13083978132768112, "compression_ratio": 1.259493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 0.011859884485602379}, {"id": 68, "seek": 35890, "start": 370.09999999999997, "end": 372.09999999999997, "text": " At\u00e9 o pr\u00f3ximo v\u00eddeo!", "tokens": [50924, 31793, 277, 21177, 8071, 0, 51